  "description": "Irina is uncomfortable. Living as a person like this, living as a Korean, living as a woman... 10-year-old Irina decided not to speak again. I just thought living like this was the least uncomfortable. Irina's live-in boyfriend, Chris, was curious about her life. I start telling Chris about memories I haven't told anyone. Talking about things I've been pretending not to know brings about a change in Irina's mind. Irana decides not to ignore the inconveniences anymore.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/61458011), [Daum](https://webtoon.kakao.com/content/%EC%98%88%EB%AF%BC%EB%B3%B4%EC%8A%A4-%EC%9D%B4%EB%A6%AC%EB%82%98/4055)",
